<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Public Transport Co lifts Q1 net profit.</title>
<headline>Saudi Public Transport Co lifts Q1 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		  21.60   vs	20.32</p>
<p> Operating income	 143.27   vs     138.33</p>
<p> Other income		 0.79   vs	 0.76</p>
<p> Operating cost	    81.38   vs	79.30</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds  1,155.57   vs   1,139.62</p>
<p> Assets		   1,904.13   vs   2,028.10</p>
<p>Full Name: The Saudi Public Transport Company.</p>
<p>Note - The Riyadh-based firm provides bus transportation in the kingdom. It is traded on the Saudi stock market.</p>
<p>Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
